<title>INDIA: India's MTNL up two pct ahead of results.</title>
<headline>India's MTNL up two pct ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mahanagar Telephone Nigam Ltd (MTNL) climbed six rupees, or 2.2 percent, to 283 on the Bombay bourse on Wednesday ahead of the firm's results, traders said.  </p>
<p>Analysts said MTNL is expected to report a jump in net profit to 8.6 billion rupees in 1996/97 (April-March), up 18 percent from 7.29 billion in the previous year.</p>
<p>MTNL's results are due later in the day.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
